OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle blaze at
OL,4,Aindustrial estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are tackling a blaze at an
OL,7,Findustrial estate in Langley Mill.
OL,9,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,10,Fit was called to the site on Hall Road
OL,11,Fat about 08:25 GMT on Thursday.
OL,13,FCrews from Alfreton, Heanor and
OL,14,FIlkeston are at the scene, along with
OL,15,Ffirefighters from Stockhill station in
OL,16,FNottinghamshire.
OL,18,FAnyone who can see or smell smoke has
OL,19,Fbeen advised to keep their windows and
OL,20,Fdoors closed, and people are asked to
OL,21,Favoid the area where possible.
